---
// Rules.astro
---

<section id="rules" class="py-8 sm:py-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-4 sm:space-y-5">
    <!-- Section Header (Compact) -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-1" data-reveal>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-rose-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">
        <span>// REGULASI //</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-1">
        Regulasi & Format Kompetisi
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary">
        Ketentuan writeup per track, aturan integritas sportivitas, dan standarisasi submission flag.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Ultra-Compact Cards Grid with Uniform Headers & Footers -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 sm:gap-3.5 items-stretch" data-reveal-group data-reveal-stagger="60">

      <!-- Card 1: Kebijakan Writeup -->
      <div data-reveal-child class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface/85 border border-white/10 hover:border-nx-cyan/40 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between motion-card">
        <div>
          <!-- Header (Uniform Height) -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2.5 pb-2 border-b border-white/5 min-h-[2rem]">
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>📝</span>
              <span>Ketentuan Writeup</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-nx-cyan/10 text-nx-cyan border border-nx-cyan/25 uppercase shrink-0">
              WU POLICY
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Body -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem]">
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Track Umum</span>
              <span class="text-[0.58rem] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-rose-500/15 text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/30">
                WAJIB
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <span class="text-text-secondary">Track Mahasiswa</span>
              <span class="text-[0.58rem] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">
                OPSIONAL
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[0.62rem] text-text-secondary px-0.5 pt-0.5">
              <span class="text-text-muted">Format Laporan:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-medium">PDF / GitHub Link</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer (Uniform Height) -->
        <div class="pt-2 mt-2.5 border-t border-white/5 min-h-[2.25rem] flex items-center font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-text-muted leading-tight">
          <span>Umum wajib kumpul WU untuk validasi hadiah & sertifikat.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Integritas & Fairplay -->
      <div data-reveal-child class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface/85 border border-white/10 hover:border-amber-400/40 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between motion-card">
        <div>
          <!-- Header (Uniform Height) -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2.5 pb-2 border-b border-white/5 min-h-[2rem]">
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>⚖️</span>
              <span>Integritas & Kode Etik</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-400/25 uppercase shrink-0">
              FAIRPLAY
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Body -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem]">
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-start gap-1.5 text-emerald-400">
              <span class="font-bold shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span class="text-text-secondary leading-tight"><strong class="text-emerald-400">Boleh:</strong> AI tools, bruteforce soal, & tools pentest.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 flex items-start gap-1.5 text-rose-400">
              <span class="font-bold shrink-0">✗</span>
              <span class="text-text-secondary leading-tight"><strong class="text-rose-400">Dilarang:</strong> Sharing flag, DoS web, & spam restart container.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[0.62rem] text-text-secondary px-0.5 pt-0.5">
              <span class="text-text-muted">Sifat Lomba:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-medium">Solo / Individu (Mandiri)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer (Uniform Height) -->
        <div class="pt-2 mt-2.5 border-t border-white/5 min-h-[2.25rem] flex items-center font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-text-muted leading-tight">
          <span>Pelanggaran aturan berakibat sanksi diskualifikasi permanen.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Format Flag & Skor -->
      <div data-reveal-child class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface/85 border border-white/10 hover:border-nf-orange/40 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between motion-card">
        <div>
          <!-- Header (Uniform Height) -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2.5 pb-2 border-b border-white/5 min-h-[2rem]">
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>🚩</span>
              <span>Format Flag & Skor</span>
            </h3>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.58rem] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-nf-orange/10 text-nf-orange-bright border border-nf-orange/25 uppercase shrink-0">
              SCORING
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Body -->
          <div class="space-y-1.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem]">
            <div class="p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-text-muted text-[0.62rem]">Flag:</span>
              <code class="text-nx-cyan font-bold text-xs">NFX&#123;...&#125;</code>
              <span class="text-[0.52rem] text-text-muted px-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5">CASE-SENSITIVE</span>
            </div>
            <!-- Complete Dynamic Scoring: Max 500, Decay 20, Min 100 -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 text-center font-mono">
              <div class="p-1 rounded bg-black/40 border border-white/5">
                <span class="text-text-muted text-[0.52rem] block uppercase">MAX</span>
                <strong class="text-emerald-400 text-xs">500</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="p-1 rounded bg-black/40 border border-white/5">
                <span class="text-text-muted text-[0.52rem] block uppercase">DECAY</span>
                <strong class="text-amber-300 text-xs">20</strong>
              </div>
              <div class="p-1 rounded bg-black/40 border border-white/5">
                <span class="text-text-muted text-[0.52rem] block uppercase">MIN</span>
                <strong class="text-nx-cyan text-xs">100</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[0.62rem] text-text-secondary px-0.5 pt-0.5">
              <span class="text-text-muted">Tie-Breaker:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-medium">Submit Tercepat ⏱</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer (Uniform Height) -->
        <div class="pt-2 mt-2.5 border-t border-white/5 min-h-[2.25rem] flex items-center font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-text-muted leading-tight">
          <span>Kredensial akun dikirimkan via email H-1 lomba.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Action Link (Compact) -->
    <div data-reveal class="text-center">
      <a
        href="/guidebook"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-text-secondary hover:text-nx-cyan transition-colors"
      >
        <span>📖 Pelajari struktur writeup & panduan lengkap di Official Guidebook</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
